{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15d0_level_act15d0_02_end",
  "groupId": "act15d0",
  "stageId": "act15d0_02",
  "title": "另一個視角",
  "storyCode": "MB-2",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5a2cff797346096494b6c45a4e066a88eb342f2e1baa7eafc9ea7710341b71c7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "疼疼疼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "忍一忍，一下就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警",
      "text": "叫什麼叫！吵死了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警",
      "text": "受了傷就去停屍間看看，別在這鬼叫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "對不起對不起，那邊現在排隊的人很多，我就先給他做一些緊急措施，馬上就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警",
      "text": "啐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "......他說的應該是醫務室吧，為什麼會叫停屍間？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "啊，那是因為這裡的醫務室和停屍間是連著的，而且醫生和入殮師是一個人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "那個人給人的感覺比較詭異，別說獄警，其實我們沒事都不太願意靠近那邊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "也只有打群架後沒有辦法才不得不去那裡接受治療。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "久而久之就叫那邊停屍間了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你需要幫忙嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "噫！杜瑪小姐，你、你怎麼來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "啊，我剛才都是瞎說的，那個......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜瑪",
      "text": "沒事，我也不太在乎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜瑪",
      "text": "比起這個，要來醫務室嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "不、不了，有這個小姑娘幫我包紮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "嗯，交給我就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜瑪",
      "text": "......你的包紮手法不錯，那就交給你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "你很怕她嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "害怕......不至於，畢竟杜瑪小姐還是救了許多人的，但是她確實挺古怪的，就單純的有些不想接近吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "好了，你動一動手臂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "......呼，好多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "你這方法真靈啊，羅賓，你以前是做什麼的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "我以前......是在私人安保公司做事的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "私人安保公司？那不是很賺錢嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "而且你性格也挺不錯，我都想不出你這樣的人會犯罪進監獄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "......我的爸爸失業後就一蹶不振，一直酗酒，肝出了很大的問題，醫藥費要很多錢，所以我就鋌而走險......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "這樣啊，嘖嘖，看來你也不容易。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "你呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "我？嘿，我是做生意的，老婆勾結情夫想把我幹掉吞併我的財產，結果最後關頭被我反殺了，就這麼簡單。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "總之，我欠你一次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "我在這邊也待了好幾年了，這裡的事情多多少少都知道一點，你有什麼問題都可以問我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "我看到平時會有幾個A區或者B區的人會進C區的塔，他們是怎麼進去的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "嗯？啊，他們啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "他們是被抓去給C區的大佬們打掃房間的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "打掃房間？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "是啊，這裡其實除了獄警之外的工作人員是很少的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "雖然是官方監獄，好像待遇也不差，但是畢竟誰都不想在監獄工作，而且還是這種成天在荒野上跑的移動監獄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "一般監獄裡想要搞什麼東西，都是停靠在城市的時候，就地雇一些人來，趁著停靠的時間搞完。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "搞不完的話就只能把他們帶上，等到搞完了派人把他們送回去，或者乾脆把他們帶到下一座城市再送走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "上次停靠聖蘇菲城的時候就雇了一群人來搞裝修，現在都已經離開聖蘇菲城半個月了還在搞呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "啊，原來那些到處走的工作人員不是監獄的人啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "對，正好，你看那邊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "（竊竊私語）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "（竊竊私語）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警",
      "text": "米娜小姐，你怎麼到這邊來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "啊，不好意思，我在找廁所，不小心走錯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警",
      "text": "啊，沒事，隊長說過了，只要不是什麼重要的地方，隨便你們走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警",
      "text": "但是你！沒事別在那站著，滾回自己的宿舍！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "看吧，雖然他們不是監獄的人，但他們是大爺，典獄長可是下過命令要把他們好吃好喝供著的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "所以這幫習慣了橫著走的獄警看到他們都跟便秘了一樣，看著還挺爽的，嘿嘿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "text": "嘖，你們兩個怎麼還聊上了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "嘿嘿，長官，帶新人，通融一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "text": "哼，再給你們5分鐘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "你怎麼會有那個......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "嘿，在這裡待久了，總是能搞到一些東西的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "你要是想要的話，我也可以給你一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "不用了，比起這個，進C區的囚犯呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "哦，總之這裡就是沒什麼工作人員嘛，但是衛生之類的總得有人搞不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "你總不會以為這幫獄警大爺會自己幹活吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "所以他們就是被抓去打掃衛生的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "不止C區，其他地方也一樣，整個監獄的清潔其實都是我們這些犯人在搞的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "不過你還別說，這事是個肥差。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "可以不用在工廠工作，還可以到處逛逛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "有時候甚至能去獄警才能去的走廊看看風景。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "走廊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "嘿，你不知道吧，二樓有個走廊，只有工作人員能去，那邊能看到整個外面的風景。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "我去過一次，嘖嘖，真不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "不過這裡的獄警也真的是討人厭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "那次看管我的獄警給我指了外面一個碑，跟我說這是他們專門為囚犯立的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "我當時多嘴問了一句給誰立的，結果他說，是給那些“逃獄”的囚犯立的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "這裡面有的是真的憑自己本事逃出去的，有的是故意被他們放出去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "因為他們最後都死在荒野上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "......不能在停靠都市的時候越獄嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "嘿，你都能想到，你以為其他人想不到？每次停靠城市的時候，所有獄警都會打起十二萬分精神。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "就算是安東尼這樣的人物也逃不出去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "安東尼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "嘿，不過要我說，他也根本不用逃出去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "安東尼雖然是囚犯，但在這裡誰不尊敬他？獄警和他說話都不敢大喘氣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "他雖然不鬧事，但是實力和威信擺在那。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "你知不知道，地下那座圖書館就是他跟典獄長提議建立的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "這麼厲害......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "嘿，這話你可別到處說，不過其實我們私下都覺得，安東尼要是想要一直待在這座監獄的話......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "那就沒典獄長什麼事了，他才是這座監獄的主人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "不過你說也是怪事，安東尼這樣的人，怎麼就來了監獄，還真就待了這麼久什麼事都沒發生呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警",
      "text": "你們談話的時間太長了，回自己的房間去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "好好，馬上，馬上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警",
      "text": "傷沒事了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "啊？沒事了沒事了，羅賓包紮得好，我好多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警",
      "text": "那就別磨蹭了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "（剛才，這個人看了我一眼......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "嘿，這個獄警居然關心了我一下，真是見鬼了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A區囚犯A",
      "text": "這次就先這樣吧，有什麼事可以再來找我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "好的，謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "......爸爸，安東尼看起來比我聽說的還要棘手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "你是誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "今天你是不是收到了一筆錢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "你就是“慷慨的J”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不錯。儘管拿去醫治你的父親吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "當然，要是你想用來改善自己的生活也沒有問題。不如說，我個人相當推薦這種方式。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "......為什麼要給我錢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "因為我很慷慨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不過，如果你想用來醫治你的父親的話，這筆錢恐怕是不夠的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "......你要我做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你很聰明，羅賓小姐，我喜歡和聰明人打交道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "那我也開誠佈公地說了，我需要你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "去曼斯菲爾德監獄，殺一個人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "曼斯菲爾德？我聽說那是一座出不來的監獄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "這你不用擔心，只要你能成事，我自有辦法讓你出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你可以好好想想，羅賓小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "我知道這很危險，也知道這樣不好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "但是......為了你的病，我會努力的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
